  "date": "2002",
  "content": "I felt great pain and was unable to move or speak. Then there was whiteness, and then complete peace. I was with my brother and father who are both deceased. I don't remember words from them, just a feeling of total peace and safety. I felt or heard my best friend, Deb, speak when she touched my hand. She said that I had to go back; it wasn't my time. Without question, I rose and went with her. Then I was back with a man who was praying over me. I felt I had not wanted to return, but did return because Deb said so. I had deep peace in me that is hard to explain.",
